# Floorplanner

A **comprehensive breakdown** of how to design kitchens and bathrooms using the Floorplanner module. This tool captures layout and material choices in a structured format, automatically (or manually) exporting your data once you finish your design. Below is a detailed overview of the features, including an **AI Design Tips** option to enhance your layouts.

